 "finding": "iced_tiny_skia 0.14.1 (engine.rs 66-135) builds a per-pixel colour buffer for a quad's whole shadow area every frame, including the part scrolled out of view. Light-theme cards carried a blurred shadow; with enough session rows for the panel to exceed the viewport the buffer reached tens of millions of pixels per frame. Removing the card shadow (style.rs card_style) restores flat memory (~155 MiB at 100 agents) and idle CPU in line with dark mode. Ten agents never showed it because the panel fit on screen.",
 "event_rate_probe": {
  "method": "agentdocker events for 20 s against a private daemon with N idle registered agents",
